z\u00e1m\u00e1ra."],"Off (customer opts in)":["Kikapcsolva (a v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 kapcsolja be)"],"On (customer opts out)":["Bekapcsolva (a v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 elutas\u00edthatja)"],"WooCommerce minimum":["WooCommerce minimum"],"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in WooCommerce \u2192 Settings \u2192 Shipping. The meter only shows when the shopper\u2019s zone has one.":["Az ingyenes sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s a WooCommerce-b\u0151l sz\u00e1rmazik, nem ebb\u0151l a m\u00e9r\u0151b\u0151l. Adj hozz\u00e1 egy Ingyenes sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s m\u00f3dszert minim\u00e1lis rendel\u00e9si \u00f6sszeggel a sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si z\u00f3n\u00e1idhoz a WooCommerce \u2192 Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok \u2192 Sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s men\u00fcben. A m\u00e9r\u0151 csak akkor jelenik meg, ha a v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 z\u00f3n\u00e1j\u00e1ban van ilyen."],"Higher free shipping goal (optional)":["Magasabb ingyenes sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1si c\u00e9l (opcion\u00e1lis)"],"Leave at 0 to use the minimum order amount from WooCommerce. A higher amount only raises the goal shown in the meter. It does not give free shipping by itself, and amounts below the WooCommerce minimum are ignored.":["Hagyj 0-t, hogy a WooCommerce minim\u00e1lis rendel\u00e9si \u00f6sszeg\u00e9t haszn\u00e1ld. Egy magasabb \u00f6sszeg csak a m\u00e9r\u0151ben megjelen\u00edtett c\u00e9lt emeli meg. Nem biztos\u00edt ingyenes sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1st, \u00e9s a WooCommerce minimuma alatti \u00f6sszegek figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00f3dnak."]}}}